  "question": {
    "text": "A body of $m \\mathrm{~kg}$ slides from rest along the curve of vertical circle from point $A$ to $B$ in friction less path. The velocity of the body at $B$ is:\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/ogI6ALu6CRH_S1yuxN8XzJeJuZkm57N_XSBdZk0nDQ8.original.fullsize.png\"><br />$\\text { (given, } R=14 \\mathrm{~m}, g=10 \\mathrm{~m} / \\mathrm{s}^2 \\text { and } \\sqrt{2}=1.4 \\text { ) }$",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "AUCZz",
      "text": "$16.7 \\mathrm{~m} / \\mathrm{s}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "I6fdc",
      "text": "$19.8 \\mathrm{~m} / \\mathrm{s}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gC1u0",
      "text": "$10.6 \\mathrm{~m} / \\mathrm{s}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "uUYnt",
      "text": "$21.9 \\mathrm{~m} / \\mathrm{s}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/FOiBkF3qGbB4VWxKLLBLnKqgk9RHfRoCeg1Vdj4R-yQ.original.fullsize.png\"><br />Apply W.E.T. from A to B\n$\\begin{aligned}\n& \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{W}_{\\mathrm{mg}}=\\mathrm{K}_{\\mathrm{B}}-\\mathrm{K}_{\\mathrm{A}} \\\\\n& \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{mg} \\times\\left(\\frac{\\mathrm{R}}{\\sqrt{2}}+\\mathrm{R}\\right)=\\frac{1}{2} \\mathrm{mv}_{\\mathrm{B}}^2-0\\left\\{\\mathrm{v}_{\\mathrm{A}}=0 \\text { rest }\\right\\} \\\\\n& \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{mgR} \\frac{(\\sqrt{2}+1)}{\\sqrt{2}}=\\frac{1}{2} \\mathrm{mv}_{\\mathrm{B}}^2 \\\\\n& \\Rightarrow \\sqrt{\\mathrm{gR} \\frac{2(\\sqrt{2}+1)}{\\sqrt{2}}}=\\mathrm{v}_{\\mathrm{B}} \\\\\n& \\Rightarrow \\sqrt{\\frac{10 \\times 14 \\times 2(2.4)}{1.4}}=\\mathrm{v}_{\\mathrm{B}} \\\\\n& \\Rightarrow 21.9=\\mathrm{v}_{\\mathrm{B}}\n\\end{aligned}$",
    "image": null
  },
